<title>UK: UK's Safeway chairman Grant to retire.</title>
<headline>UK's Safeway chairman Grant to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British supermarket chain Safeway Plc said on Wednesday that chairman Sir Alistair Grant would retire and be succeeded by deputy chairman David Webster.</p>
<p>Webster will serve as chairman with effect from March 28, the company said in a statement. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
